  "description": "The Ceres UB2 is not just the ideal city bike, it is also well suited to weekend recreational use too thanks to the lightweight aluminium frame, rigid fork, road bike-sized wheels and 9 gears. The shifting from the Advent RD-R4009-L groupset is slick and the hydraulic disc brakes provide confidence-inspiring stopping power even in the wet. The Kenda K935 tyres are wide enough for comfort but not so wide as to unduly affect rolling speed, and they have a puncture-resistant \"K-Shield\" with ceramic particles under the tread that protects from punctures and increases tire life.\n\nAluminum alloy frame for stiff but light construction allows you to convert more of your power into speed\n\nHydraulic Disc Brakes for reliable braking in all weather",
